<bar protocol-version="0" min-app-version="0.3.0" id="tempmail" title="TempMail.Best" version="0.1.0" description="Create a temporary inbox, read incoming mail, and copy verification codes." icon="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%2224%22%20height%3D%2224%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2024%2024%22%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%221%22%20y%3D%221%22%20width%3D%2222%22%20height%3D%2222%22%20rx%3D%226%22%20fill%3D%22%2309090b%22%20stroke%3D%22%2327272a%22%20stroke-width%3D%221%22%2F%3E%3Cg%20transform%3D%22translate(5%205)%20scale(0.583)%22%3E%3Cpath%20fill%3D%22%23ffffff%22%20d%3D%22M3%203h18a1%201%200%200%201%201%201v16a1%201%200%200%201-1%201H3a1%201%200%200%201-1-1V4a1%201%200%200%201%201-1m17%204.238l-7.928%207.1L4%207.216V19h16zM4.511%205l7.55%206.662L19.502%205z%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%2219.5%22%20cy%3D%2219.5%22%20r%3D%223%22%20fill%3D%22%235073ee%22%20stroke%3D%22%2309090b%22%20stroke-width%3D%221.5%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" category="utilities" refresh="0" material="solid" open-mode="window" window-style="standard" homepage="https://github.com/miantiao-me/tempmail.bar" license="Apache-2.0">
  <locale lang="zh-Hans" title="TempMail.Best" description="创建临时收件箱、阅读来信并一键复制验证码。" />
  <permissions>
    <network origin="https://tempmail.best" />
  </permissions>
  <inputs>
    <input name="lang" type="select" label="Language" default="auto">
      <locale lang="zh-Hans" label="语言" />
      <option value="auto" label="Follow Metrix.Bar"><locale lang="zh-Hans" label="跟随 Metrix.Bar" /></option>
      <option value="en" label="English" />
      <option value="zh" label="简体中文" />
    </input>
    <input name="mailboxToken" type="secret" label="Mailbox session (managed)" help="Managed automatically; no manual token needed">
      <locale lang="zh-Hans" label="邮箱会话（自动管理）" help="由创建流程自动保存，无需手动填写" />
    </input>
    <input name="notify" type="bool" label="New mail alerts" default="true" help="Alert on new mail with the detected code">
      <locale lang="zh-Hans" label="新邮件通知" help="收到新邮件时提醒，识别出的验证码直接显示在通知里" />
    </input>
  </inputs>
  <docs><![CDATA[Create a 10-minute or 1-hour temporary inbox from your menu bar — receive-only, with no API key required.

How to use
1. Pick 10 minutes or 1 hour and click Create inbox.
2. Copy the address; incoming messages appear automatically (refreshes every 15s while open, 60s when closed).
3. Copy detected verification codes in one click from the top banner or new-mail notifications.

Privacy & limits
- Messages are rendered as plain text with no remote images or scripts.
- Session credentials stay in your OS Keychain; message bodies stay in memory only.
- Polling stops automatically when the inbox expires.]]>
    <locale lang="zh-Hans"><![CDATA[从菜单栏一键创建 10 分钟或 1 小时临时邮箱，只收件，无需 API Key。

使用方式
1. 选择 10 分钟或 1 小时，点击「创建邮箱」。
2. 复制地址即可收信，展开窗口每 15 秒刷新、收起每 60 秒刷新。
3. 识别出的验证码会置顶显示，也可在新邮件通知中直接查看并一键复制。

安全与限制
- 来信转为原生纯文本显示，不执行脚本，不加载外部图片。
- 邮箱会话安全保存在系统钥匙串中，邮件正文仅驻留内存。
- 到期后自动停止轮询，删除或换新前均需二次确认。]]></locale>
  </docs>
